  "description": "VOODOO NZUMBI 26”\n\nNot long ago the wheel size of almost all MTBs, 26” wheels remain a solid option for young riders and shorter adults. The Nzumbi adopts this classic wheel size in a modern geometry alloy frame. Light enough for the bike to feel nimble and agile, and yet strong enough to endure tough rides and treatment from youngsters, both in age and in spirit.\n\nThe frame is equipped with easy to use Shimano 1x drivetrain, powerful disc brakes, 120 mm travel suspension fork, grippy wide tyres and lightweight alloy components and wheels. All of this contributes towards a ride that is both fun and capable. From quick adventures in the surroundings, to all day long family rides.\n\nNzumbi is a perfect bike for 9+ year old youngsters, as well as for shorter adults.",
